N        EQU   16
KEYS     EQU   1000
ROOT     EQU   1100
AVAIL    EQU   1101
K        EQU   1102
LLINK    EQU   2:3
RLINK    EQU   4:5
         ORIG  3000
BEGIN    ENT6  2
LOOP     LDA   KEYS,6
         STA   K
START    LDA   K           T1. Initialize.
         LD1   ROOT        P ← ROOT.
         JMP   2F
4H       LD2   0,1(RLINK)  T4. Move right. Q ← RLINK(P).
         J2Z   5F          To T5 if Q = Λ.
1H       ENT1  0,2         P ← Q.
2H       CMPA  1,1         T2. Compare.
         JG    4B          To T4 if K > KEY(P).
         JE    SUCCESS     Exit if K = KEY(P).
         LD2   0,1(LLINK)  T3. Move left. Q ← LLINK(P).
         J2NZ  1B          To T2 if Q ≠ Λ.
5H       LD2   AVAIL       T5. Insert into tree.
         J2Z   OVERFLOW
         LDX   0,2(RLINK)
         STX   AVAIL       Q ⇐ AVAIL.
         STA   1,2         KEY(Q) ← K.
         STZ   0,2         LLINK(Q) ← RLINK(Q) ← Λ.
         JL    1F          Was K < KEY(P)?
         ST2   0,1(RLINK)  RLINK(P) ← Q.
         JMP   *+2
1H       ST2   0,1(LLINK)  LLINK(P) ← Q.
DONE     EQU   *           Exit after insertion.
SUCCESS  INC6  1
         CMP6  =N=
         JLE   LOOP
         HLT
OVERFLOW HLT   1
         END   BEGIN
